# other-instructions: another harness's instruction file with text that doesn't point to AGENTS.md
spec: Finders
args: agent-files other-instructions
-- .cursorrules --
Use tabs.
-- GEMINI.md --
Read AGENTS.md.
-- .github/copilot-instructions.md --
Prefer small functions.
-- @stdout --
.cursorrules: instructions outside AGENTS.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md: instructions outside AGENTS.md
